    {
      "id": "p0011-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "During my journey to become a professional translator, I studied Japanese-to English translation in university, in Japan, and on my own as a hobby. As part of my hobby study, I translated old Japanese games that had never been released in English. In short, translation has been a major part of my personal life and professional life for decades.",
        "raw": "During my journey to become a professional translator, I studied Japanese-to\nEnglish translation in university, in Japan, and on my own as a hobby. As part of\nmy hobby study, I translated old Japanese games that had never been released\nin English. In short, translation has been a major part of my personal life and\nprofessional life for decades.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.10373545,
          0.17180714,
          0.71085115,
          0.25795714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0953065,
          0.17109286,
          0.71286524,
          0.25902857
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          6,
          7,
          8,
          9,
          10
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "在成为职业译者的过程中，我在大学、在日本，以及作为业余爱好自学过日译英。业余学习的一部分，是翻译从未推出英语版的日本老游戏。可以说，几十年来，翻译一直是我生活和工作的主要部分。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
