    {
      "id": "p0011-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Basically, I just really like translation and showing how the translation process works. Naturally, this detailed look at Undertale's Japanese translation is another passion project for me.",
        "raw": "Basically, I just really like translation and showing how the translation process\nworks. Naturally, this detailed look at Underta/e's Japanese translation is\nanother passion project for me.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.10375559,
          0.37418571,
          0.70134467,
          0.4225
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0953065,
          0.37347143,
          0.71286524,
          0.42357143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          16,
          17,
          18
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "我就是很喜欢翻译，也很喜欢向大家展示翻译的过程。如此细看 Undertale 的日语翻译，自然又是一个出于热爱的项目。",
        "status": "draft",
