    {
      "id": "p0011-b006",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "From time to time, I'll share my thoughts and insights about Undertale, localization, business experiences, personal experiences, and so on. So keep your eyes out for the little tomato! Well, not literally \"out\". That would be weird.",
        "raw": "From time to time, I'll share my thoughts and insights about Undertale,\nlocalization, business experiences, personal experiences, and so on. So keep your\neyes out for the little tomato! Well, not literally \"out\". That would be weird.",
